  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">URGFB Sesame Production Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Sesame production and export, Beneficiaries: 585 women, Description: The 25 member women groups will be provided equipment, (oxen plows, carts, tarps, sieves), a fund to access quality seeds and fertilizers, a storage facility at the departmental level, and training in production and post-harvest handling of sesame, organizational and financial management.</narrative>
  </description>
